        terms of Rule 3 of the Information Technology (Intermediary
        Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Rules, 2021 (as amended)
        read with the Information Technology Act, 2000 (as amended), and
        does not require any physical or digital signatures.
      </p>

