        agreement between you ("<strong>You</strong>", "<strong>Your</strong>",
        "<strong>Yourself</strong>", "<strong>Buyer</strong>") and
        <strong>{entity.name}</strong>
        ("<strong>{entity.name.split(' ')[0]}</strong>", "<strong>we</strong>",
        "<strong>us</strong>", or "<strong>our</strong>"), a {entity.type.toLowerCase()}
        owned and represented by <strong>{entity.owner}</strong>, with its
        principal place of business at {entity.address}.
      </p>
      <p>
        {entity.taxIdLabel}: <strong>{entity.taxId}</strong>.
        Contact: <a href={`mailto:${entity.email}`}>{entity.email}</a>.
        These Terms govern Your access to and use of the website
        <code>{site.domain}</code> on the <code>/in/</code> variant
        ("<strong>Platform</strong>") and the digital products and related
        services made available through it ("<strong>Services</strong>").
        The Services are intended for use in India.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Acceptance &amp; eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        By submitting a lead-capture form, downloading the free Vibe Coder
        Kit, completing a checkout transaction for any paid agent
        agent, or otherwise accessing the Platform, You confirm that
        You have read, understood and accepted these Terms. If You do not
        agree, do not use the Service.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may register or transact only if You are at least 18 years of
        age and competent to enter into a binding contract under the Indian
        Contract Act, 1872. You are responsible for the secrecy of any
        login or order-confirmation credentials and for all activities
        carried out under Your account or transaction reference.
      </p>

      <h2>3. The Services</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Free Vibe Coder Kit</strong> — a Claude Code / Codex / OpenClaws configuration package provided at no cost in exchange for the contact information You submit through the lead form.</li>
        <li><strong>Paid AI agents</strong> — source-available repositories You may purchase à la carte or as part of the AI Digital Marketing Stack bundle. Each purchase is a one-time transaction granting You a perpetual licence under the Business Source License 1.1 (BSL 1.1) for the purchased agent, with the rights and restrictions stated in the licence file inside each repository.</li>
