          <a href="https://razorpay.com/terms/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">terms of use</a>
          and
          <a href="https://razorpay.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          {entity.name} does <strong>not</strong> store Your card, UPI VPA
          or net-banking credentials. Such instrument data is collected and
          tokenised by Razorpay in compliance with the RBI's
          card-tokenisation framework.
        </li>
        <li>Where applicable, GST under {entity.taxIdLabel} <strong>{entity.taxId}</strong> is collected and remitted by {entity.name} per the Central Goods and Services Tax Act, 2017.</li>
        <li>Razorpay may, at its sole discretion and in compliance with applicable RBI Card Payment Network Rules, decline, hold or reverse a transaction. Any such action by Razorpay is outside {entity.name}'s control.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Refund &amp; cancellation</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Free Vibe Coder Kit</strong> — no payment, no refund. You may unsubscribe from associated communications at any time.</li>
        <li><strong>Individual paid AI agents (BSK-001 to BSK-006)</strong> — eligible for a full refund within <strong>14 days</strong> of purchase, requested by replying to Your Razorpay receipt or emailing <a href={`mailto:${entity.email}`}>{entity.email}</a>. After 14 days no refunds are issued, in line with the digital-goods nature of the Service.</li>
        <li><strong>AI Digital Marketing Stack bundle (BSK-ALL)</strong> — eligible for a full refund within <strong>7 days</strong> of purchase via the same channel. The shorter window reflects the bundle's substantially higher value and the corresponding asymmetry in risk where source code is delivered immediately on purchase. After 7 days the bundle is non-refundable.</li>
        <li>On any refund, Your access to the private repository, Discord paid channels, and lifetime-update entitlement is revoked, and Your licence under Section 6 terminates with effect from the refund date.</li>
        <li>Approved refunds are processed back to the original payment instrument via Razorpay, typically within <strong>5–7 working days</strong> from confirmation, subject to issuing-bank settlement timelines.</li>
        <li>
          For payment disputes (chargebacks, fraudulent debit allegations),
          You may reach Razorpay's grievance redressal channel at
          <a href="https://razorpay.com/grievances/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">razorpay.com/grievances</a>
          in addition to contacting us directly.
        </li>
      </ul>

