        consequential, or punitive damages, including lost profits, lost
        data, or business interruption, even if advised of the
        possibility of such damages.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Indemnity</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to indemnify, defend and hold harmless {entity.name},
        its proprietor, employees, agents and contractors from and
        against any claim, demand, loss, liability or expense (including
