      </p>

      <h2>12. Anti-bribery, sanctions &amp; export controls</h2>
      <p>
        You represent and warrant that You will comply with all
        applicable anti-bribery laws (including the Prevention of
        Corruption Act, 1988) and that You are not subject to any trade
        sanctions or export-control restriction imposed by India, the
        United Nations, or any jurisdiction whose laws apply to Your use
        of the Services. You shall not use the Services in any manner
        that would cause {entity.name} to violate such laws.
      </p>

      <h2>13. Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Personal information collected through the lead-capture form and
        purchase flow is processed in accordance with our
        <a href="/in/legal/privacy"> India Privacy Policy</a>, which
        describes the data we collect, the purposes of processing, Your
        rights under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023
        ("DPDPA") and the Information Technology (Reasonable Security
        Practices and Procedures and Sensitive Personal Data or
        Information) Rules, 2011, and how to exercise those rights.
      </p>

      <h2>14. Suspension &amp; termination</h2>
      <p>
        {entity.name} may suspend or terminate Your access to the
        Service for material breach of these Terms, suspected fraud, or
        on instructions from a competent authority, with reasonable
        notice unless the breach is egregious. Sections 5 to 12, 14, and
